WEBVTT

1
00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:29.791


2
00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:33.166
<b>Arjuna now sees only darkness in the future, </b>

3
00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.333
<b>In this verse, he says, </b>

4
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:36.791
<b>"O Krishna,</b>

5
00:00:36.791 --> 00:00:44.541
<b>I do not see any good coming from</b>
<b>slaying my own kinsmen in this battle. </b>

6
00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:52.250
<b>I no longer desire the victory, kingdom, and</b>
<b>pleasures it would bring."</b>

7
00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:57.083


8
00:00:57.083 --> 00:00:59.875
<b>A conflict is raging within Arjuna,</b>

9
00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:02.916
<b>he is arguing with himself.</b>

10
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:04.791
<b>He's asking questions to himself</b>

11
00:01:04.791 --> 00:01:07.083
<b>and answering them himself.</b>

12
00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:09.375
<b>What will happen by fighting this war?</b>

13
00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:10.666
<b>Victory will be achieved, </b>

14
00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:14.500
<b>kingdom, wealth, and fame will be attained</b>

15
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.750
<b>But after that?</b>

16
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:18.958
<b>What about going to</b>
<b>the gates of hell afterwards?</b>

17
00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:21.166
<b>Why would one have to go to the gates of hell?</b>

18
00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:27.083
<b>Staining one's hands with the blood of</b>
<b>loved ones, defeating them, isn't this a sin? </b>

19
00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:29.958
<b>It's certainly the gateway to hell.</b>

20
00:01:29.958 --> 00:01:31.041
<b>But</b>

21
00:01:31.041 --> 00:01:35.208
<b>think about the war that stands</b>
<b>before us with its mouth open.</b>

22
00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:35.958
<b>No,</b>

23
00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:40.166
<b>I'm afraid of what will happen after the war.</b>

24
00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:44.416
<b>Arjuna's mind is tangled like</b>
<b>a broken string from a cut kite.</b>

25
00:01:44.416 --> 00:01:49.250
<b>Lord Sri Krishna will certainly</b>
<b>untangle this mind-like string later on, </b>

26
00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:54.208
<b>and will also awaken in</b>
<b>Arjuna the power to solve all this dilemma, </b>

27
00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:55.041
<b>However,</b>

28
00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:58.250
<b>at this time, the situation is certainly</b>
<b>one of argument and counter-argument... </b>

29
00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:03.416
<b>and we can learn some life lessons</b>
<b>from this argument as well.</b>

30
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.208


31
00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:12.750
<b>Arjuna is forgetting</b>
<b>righteousness/unrighteousness here, </b>

32
00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.250
<b>that's why he's distressed.</b>

33
00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:16.833
<b>In his mind, </b>

34
00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:18.916
<b> and in your mind too,</b>

35
00:02:18.916 --> 00:02:22.958
<b>the light of knowledge will certainly ignite later.</b>

36
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:27.333
<b>Everything will start to appear clear.</b>

37
00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:29.041
<b>But</b>

38
00:02:29.041 --> 00:02:32.333
<b>here the situation is grand,</b>

39
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:34.833
<b>it's about the whole of India,</b>

40
00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:36.416
<b>many subjects,</b>

41
00:02:36.416 --> 00:02:41.166
<b>millions and billions of people.</b>

42
00:02:41.166 --> 00:02:43.916
<b>The circumstances of your personal life</b>

43
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:48.208
<b>may not be as dire as this great war,</b>

44
00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:53.291
<b>not about righteousness/unrighteousness</b>
<b>pervading the earth.</b>

45
00:02:53.291 --> 00:02:54.791
<b>In such a case, </b>

46
00:02:54.791 --> 00:02:56.958
<b>this internal argument of Arjuna</b>

47
00:02:56.958 --> 00:03:01.458
<b>can certainly teach you lessons.</b>

48
00:03:01.458 --> 00:03:05.083
<b>Arjuna is concerned about his loved ones here, </b>

49
00:03:05.083 --> 00:03:11.208
<b>not at all worried about</b>
<b>fame, wealth, and kingdom.</b>

50
00:03:11.208 --> 00:03:15.916
<b>What are you trying to achieve</b>
<b>in your personal life?	</b>

51
00:03:15.916 --> 00:03:17.958
<b>Is it just</b>

52
00:03:17.958 --> 00:03:20.333
<b>external success? </b>

53
00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:23.125
<b>Or inner happiness?</b>

54
00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:26.708
<b>In this race for success,</b>

55
00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:30.541
<b>are you not overlooking those</b>

56
00:03:30.541 --> 00:03:35.291
<b>who love you selflessly?</b>

57
00:03:35.291 --> 00:03:38.125
<b>What are you accumulating? </b>

58
00:03:38.125 --> 00:03:42.333
<b>Expensive, lifeless objects of glitter and shine? </b>

59
00:03:42.333 --> 00:03:43.458
<b>Wealth</b>

60
00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:44.625
<b>house</b>

61
00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:45.833
<b>car</b>

62
00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:48.708
<b>or are you also gathering  </b>

63
00:03:48.708 --> 00:03:49.458
<b>love, </b>

64
00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:50.208
<b>affection,</b>

65
00:03:50.208 --> 00:03:51.291
<b>family,</b>

66
00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:54.791
<b>and friends along the way?</b>

67
00:03:54.791 --> 00:03:55.916
<b>Often,</b>

68
00:03:55.916 --> 00:03:58.333
<b> humans start loving objects</b>

69
00:03:58.333 --> 00:04:01.708
<b>and using people,</b>

70
00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:07.416
<b>when in reality people are made for love,</b>

71
00:04:07.416 --> 00:04:11.208
<b>and objects for use.</b>

72
00:04:11.208 --> 00:04:14.875
<b>Hope you're not doing this, are you?</b>

73
00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:19.541


74
00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:21.750
<b>For ourselves,</b>

75
00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:26.500
<b>and for those younger than us in the family,</b>

76
00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:32.125
<b>we need to understand the</b>
<b>the meaning of Shreyas and Preyas,</b>

77
00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:33.166
<b>and</b>

78
00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:38.208
<b>follow it in life.</b>

79
00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:40.208
<b>Shreyas</b>

80
00:04:40.208 --> 00:04:42.750
<b>Shreyas are actions</b>

81
00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:45.125
<b>that lead to long-term well-being,</b>

82
00:04:45.125 --> 00:04:46.166
<b>benefit,</b>

83
00:04:46.166 --> 00:04:49.125
<b>and ultimate good.</b>

84
00:04:49.125 --> 00:04:50.208
<b>These actions</b>

85
00:04:50.208 --> 00:04:53.000
<b>may not provide immediate satisfaction,</b>

86
00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.333
<b>but</b>

87
00:04:54.333 --> 00:04:56.208
<b> they certainly contribute to spiritual growth,</b>

88
00:04:56.208 --> 00:04:57.958
<b>physical development,</b>

89
00:04:57.958 --> 00:04:59.416
<b>moral growth, </b>

90
00:04:59.416 --> 00:05:04.375
<b>and the welfare of all.</b>

91
00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:06.208
<b>Preyas</b>

92
00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:08.250
<b>Preyas are actions</b>

93
00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:10.083
<b>that provide immediate pleasure</b>

94
00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:13.375
<b>or material happiness.</b>

95
00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:16.958
<b>These actions are certainly attractive,</b>

96
00:05:16.958 --> 00:05:18.166
<b>but</b>

97
00:05:18.166 --> 00:05:22.541
<b>they may not bring long-term benefits.</b>

98
00:05:22.541 --> 00:05:25.875
<b>For example,</b>

99
00:05:25.875 --> 00:05:31.041
<b>doing yoga or exercise every morning</b>
<b>is a Shreyas action.</b>

100
00:05:31.041 --> 00:05:34.166
<b>It may not bring immediate benefits,</b>

101
00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:35.166
<b>but</b>

102
00:05:35.166 --> 00:05:40.583
<b>the benefits it does bring</b>
<b>will last for a long time.</b>

103
00:05:40.583 --> 00:05:43.833
<b>More Shreyas, and minimum Preyas.</b>

104
00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:44.833
<b>Just</b>

105
00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:48.791
<b>tie this mantra in your knot,</b>

106
00:05:48.791 --> 00:05:49.958
<b>for yourself</b>

107
00:05:49.958 --> 00:05:52.666
<b>and for your family too.</b>

108
00:05:52.666 --> 00:05:54.916
<b>If you follow this,</b>

109
00:05:54.916 --> 00:05:58.583
<b>and encourage family and friends to do so,</b>

110
00:05:58.583 --> 00:06:02.041
<b>everyone's life will be prosperous.</b>

111
00:06:02.541 --> 00:06:06.708


112
00:06:06.708 --> 00:06:08.500
<b>Picking up the Gandiva</b>

113
00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.083
<b>and shooting arrows </b>

114
00:06:10.083 --> 00:06:13.875
<b> is the easiest task for Arjuna.</b>

115
00:06:13.875 --> 00:06:15.708
<b>But,</b>

116
00:06:15.708 --> 00:06:17.041
<b>here he's</b>

117
00:06:17.041 --> 00:06:20.250
<b>not thinking about personal fame,</b>

118
00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:26.208
<b>nor about the kingdom he'll get after the war.</b>

119
00:06:26.208 --> 00:06:30.208
<b>He's thinking beyond that, </b>

120
00:06:30.208 --> 00:06:32.791
<b>he's considering</b>

121
00:06:32.791 --> 00:06:37.750
<b>will this be in everyone's interest? </b>

122
00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:42.416
<b>Won't he taint his soul,</b>

123
00:06:42.416 --> 00:06:48.541
<b>will he and everyone else be able to live</b>
<b>happily after all this?</b>

124
00:06:48.541 --> 00:06:50.583
<b>In professional life too,</b>

125
00:06:50.583 --> 00:06:54.083
<b>long-term thinking is extremely necessary.</b>

126
00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:57.375
<b>If you lead a group, </b>

127
00:06:57.375 --> 00:07:01.458
<b>your decisions will affect not just you,</b>

128
00:07:01.458 --> 00:07:03.958
<b>but many people.</b>

129
00:07:03.958 --> 00:07:06.708
<b>The way you conduct yourself,</b>

130
00:07:06.708 --> 00:07:11.666
<b>your colleagues will follow suit.</b>

131
00:07:11.666 --> 00:07:15.625
<b>Any organization doesn't have its own form; </b>

132
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:22.166
<b>it and its people adopt the</b>
<b>form of those who lead.</b>

133
00:07:22.166 --> 00:07:25.875
<b>Carefully probe and weigh the impact</b>
<b>of your decisions, </b>

134
00:07:25.875 --> 00:07:29.833
<b>maintain good conduct.</b>

135
00:07:29.833 --> 00:07:32.541
<b>Don't think of momentary success,</b>

136
00:07:32.541 --> 00:07:34.250
<b>think long-term.</b>

